c̲o̲m̲m̲e̲n̲t̲ The input procedures of the X1 library: read, RESYM, XEEN;
b̲e̲g̲i̲n̲ i̲n̲t̲e̲g̲e̲r̲ i, c;
    print(XEEN(255), XEEN(6)); NLCR;
    f̲o̲r̲ i := 1 s̲t̲e̲p̲ 1 u̲n̲t̲i̲l̲ 8 d̲o̲ b̲e̲g̲i̲n̲ print(read); SPACE(1) e̲n̲d̲;
    NLCR;
